      <div class="quote-grid">
        <div class="diffcard">
          <p class="vs"><span style="color:var(--ice)">&#9632;</span> Permissive &mdash; MIT OR Apache-2.0</p>
          <p><code>callisto-model</code>, <code>callisto-format</code>, <code>callisto-vcs</code> &mdash; the schema, grammar, and VCS primitives third parties can depend on without AGPL entanglement.</p>
        </div>
